"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Food, Nightlife","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"XncT8ubN1EcqJDfIYNUiEQ","review_id":"D4Bg4n3wyIfd1iw7JNSVHw","date":"2020-05-17T02:15:13","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9377532005310059,"text_excerpt":"Let me just start by saying Happy Raptor is AMAZING!!! This business not only has a great product, labeling, and has adapted so well for COVID.. I applaud them! Appointments. Listen, I like having an appointment for my cocktails and spirit purchases. It makes me feel so exclusive and like a celebrity to get my time to go pick up! When you get your appointment, you don't have to worry about seeing anyone there that isn't an employee there! The location is also seriously sanitized. Make sure to review their website and make your appointment before going pickup, do so at least two hours in advance, but I suggest a day in advance to get your preferred time. Note: This is a cashless location. ..."},{"business_id":"XncT8ubN1EcqJDfIYNUiEQ","review_id":"v8PJuhhbkAWQnR_-WXIWaQ","date":"2021-02-10T02:23:37","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9355588555335999,"text_excerpt":"I am excited for this new find! The bartenders were so lovely and helpful. They told us about their rum and let us sample some. We ended up getting a cocktail which was delicious, so tasty, and buying a bottle of their hibiscus rum. The bottle is beauuuuutiful. I can't get over how pretty the label is. I love their rum, but also that it is made locally and with Louisiana ingredients. Their physical space is nice to visit. They had outdoor seating on the sidewalk and in their back courtyard. I have seen they also will partner and have food popups to enjoy. I hope they are here to stay!"},{"business_id":"XncT8ubN1EcqJDfIYNUiEQ","review_id":"w8oYbTBXHvZvLjvVSmvsYg","date":"2020-05-18T19:17:23","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9330438375473022,"text_excerpt":"I LOVE this distillery. I had the pleasure of trying the hibiscus lemonade as part of the Yelp elite event last week. I also bought rum punch and a guava daiquiri. The rum punch was a huge hit with my friends the following day and the guava daiquiri was my personal favorite - super unique and well balanced. I'll definitely be back. The staff is very sociable, knowledgeable and laid back. And it's in a very easy location. Definitely recommend trying out whatever brews seem good to you :) You can walk in and they'll probably be around to serve you but if you're traveling from afar, you should make an appointment to be sure :)"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"XncT8ubN1EcqJDfIYNUiEQ","photo_id":"5OKk5-7LDmAnvBGzxeTRig","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/5OKk5-7LDmAnvBGzxeTRig.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8666698932647705},{"business_id":"XncT8ubN1EcqJDfIYNUiEQ","photo_id":"l3XkHGCmgR8zQ1bGHt-gKg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/l3XkHGCmgR8zQ1bGHt-gKg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8631575107574463},{"business_id":"XncT8ubN1EcqJDfIYNUiEQ","photo_id":"jpJ_PMttvaTGjmxnLC1XVg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/jpJ_PMttvaTGjmxnLC1XVg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8561772108078003},{"business_id":"XncT8ubN